    "description": "The excited Music Dual Game FNF Mod Originql finally coming for the android devices! download it and enjoy playing music battle game, full week with many song & characters, enjoy playing fmf mod game every day & every night, no internet required you can play it every day at day or at night like Sunday night, Monday night, Tuesday night, Wednesday night, Thursday night, Friday night and Saturday night.\r\nThis is fnf mods complete game with over 10 mods like fmf mods, daddy dearest, spooky month, pico, garcello, whitty, tankman, huggy wuggy, tabi and agoti mod,\r\nthe FNF Music is an amazing Music Rhythm game where the main character FNF Boy faces multiple opponents in some cool rap duels. Another incredible FNF Music Battle! Have fun! And enjoy fnf mods music battle game on android devices,\r\nYou wanna hang out with your girlfriend on Friday night but her dad does actually not like that. To have 100% agree from him, you need to beat him, and other enemies ... by fnf music game.\r\n\r\nMusic Dual Game Funkin Features:\r\n_ Over 10 weeks with Tutorial mod\r\n_ Free Play & Story Mode\r\n_ The Bot Mode in freeplay And to skip the hardest level week\r\n_ Optimized for Androidmobile\r\n_ Many control mode Hitbox, Right, Left, Custom\r\n_ Many Note type Left Right, Left And Right, Center\r\n_ Intense rhythm-based gameplay with dance battles.\r\n_ Engaging music tracks that will get your toes tapping.\r\n_ Challenge yourself with increasing difficulty levels and unlock new songs.\r\n\r\nHow To Play Game Fnf Mod Game Funkin:\r\nYou had better press at Funkin arrows and make them exactly match as perfectly as you can to get the highest score and climb to the top rank.\r\nImmerse yourself in fast-paced gameplay as you tap along to catchy tunes while facing off against opponents, and master their unique dance moves.\r\nFollow the rhythm and hit the arrows with precision to outperform rivals and make the crowd go wild.\r\nCan you keep up with the funky choreography and become the ultimate dance champion?\r\nAre you ready to flush away the competition and become the champion of the dancefloor?\r\n\r\nDownload fnf mod originall game now and prove your rhythm skills in this hilarious and unique musical adventure!\r\n\r\nfor fans with love..:",
